OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused smiled after
OL,4,Astabbing, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers accused of murder were
OL,7,Fcaught on CCTV "smiling and shaking
OL,8,Fhands" shortly after a 16-year-old was
OL,9,Fstabbed to death, a court has heard.
OL,11,FBaye Bireme Fall, known as BB, died
OL,12,Ffrom a single stab wound after a
OL,13,Fconfrontation near the Ortongate
OL,14,FShopping Centre in Peterborough on 12
OL,15,FApril.
OL,17,FEmidas Krutkevicius, 18, from Garton
OL,18,FEnd Road, Peterborough, and a
OL,19,F15-year-old boy, who cannot be named
OL,20,Ffor legal reasons, are on trial at
OL,21,FPeterborough Crown Court where they
OL,22,Fdeny murder.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
