OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused smiled after
OL,4,Astabbing, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Kate Wilkinson told jurors
OL,7,Fit appeared there was a "disagreement"
OL,8,Fbetween friends of Krutkevicius and
OL,9,FBaye and the two were due to meet "to
OL,10,Fresolve the issue".
